menu "Shell App Test Scenarios"

    config SHELL_APP
        bool "root config of the shell app test scenarios"
        default n
        help
           Root config of the zephyr-shell app test scenarios under
           src/shell_app. Enable it plus the per-scenario options below
           (usually via the "shell" snippet).


    config SHELL_APP_A2DP_SRC
        bool "A2DP source play-music shell test module"
        depends on SHELL_APP && SHELL
        default n
        help
          Shell-driven A2DP-source test: scan / connect a headphone / play
          local music (MP3 if present, else synthetic SBC) / stop, via the
          `a2dp_src` shell command. Decoupled test module; event_bus for coupling.

    config SHELL_APP_WIFI_BASIC
        bool "WiFi basic shell test module"
        depends on SHELL_APP && SHELL && WIFI
        default n
        help
          Shell-driven WiFi test: enter / connect AP (SSID+password) /
          uplink throughput (ATWT client) / downlink throughput (ATWT server),
          via the `wifi` shell command. Decoupled via event_bus.


    config SHELL_APP_DLPS
        bool "DLPS power-consumption shell test module"
        depends on SHELL_APP && SHELL && PM
        default n
        help
          Shell-driven DLPS power test: enter (BT off, DLPS mode on) /
          40m / 100m / 200m CPU frequency cycles / stop / status.
          Each test cycle: CPU active 500 us, sleep 65.5 ms (66 ms period).

    config SHELL_APP_BLE_THROUGHPUT
        bool "BLE throughput monitor shell module"
        depends on SHELL_APP && SHELL
        default n
        help
          Read-only shell front-end for the Phone-driven LE throughput GATT
          service in src/app. Subscribes to pushed test snapshots via event_bus
          and exposes `ble_throughput` commands: enter / exit / status / report / link /
          monitor / reset, plus `stop` (the only control) to abort a test.

endmenu
